a diana diaku mu Yave","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"tona buabu nate mu zithangu zioso.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yom_bib/PSA/131.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yom_bib/PSA/132.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yom_bib/PSA/130.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}